An '''Old Republic Mint''' was an underground location where the [[Galactic Republic]] produced [[Currency|money]] in the form of [[Credit ingot]]s.<ref name="Lot to Learn">{{SkeletonCrew|You Have a Lot to Learn About Pirates}}</ref> As of [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{SkeletonCrewDate}}</ref> only [[At Attin Mint|one mint]] remained in service, continuing to produce credits on the lost [[planet]] [[At Attin]]<ref name="Lot to Learn" /> as its people remained cut off from the greater galaxy and larger affairs.<ref name="Astrogation Problem">{{SkeletonCrew|Very Interesting, As an Astrogation Problem}}</ref>

